part asks_a12
  tally 1
  note "A-12 · Ten years on (questions.md): as of 2035-12-31, known as of 2026-01-15, one ask per path and per path under the what-if (t25_<path>). January 2026 invests what A-HR1 v2 gives, a hole (the card average reads records not imported, and see A-10), so the walk's places are holes from 2026-01-15; the _jan0 asks pin January's sum at 0 to show the rest. The wrap tax reads the register's contributions to 2025, a hole (O:A-1)."

